<metadata><name>Snowlands 1001 Martin Point</name><desc>out and back to waypoint 7; or continue as loop. 4.4 miles round trip or 4.7 miles round trip via alternate return route. Line traced from Marcus Libkind's map, tours.snowlands.org/tours/10/1001_tour.htm</desc></metadata>
